# git_provenance.spl    — collected git facts + the ancestry/freshness decision.
# promotion_receipt.spl — PromotionReceipt, canonical encoding, sign/verify.
# promotion_gate.spl    — the single admission point for a main-namespace mapping.
#
# Git identity is PROVENANCE. It never enters an ActionDigest.
